    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** A STUNNING THREE BEDROOM (THREE BATHROOM) SEMI-DETACHED FAMILY HOME, B ENERGY RATING, CLOSE TO ALL LOCAL AMENITIES, WALKING DISTANCE TO THE SQUARE SHOPPING CENTRE AND TALLGHT LUAS, EXCELLENT CONDITION THROUGHOUT AND A LOVELY REAR GARDEN*** Byrne Malone Estate Agents are delighted to present 11 Deerpark Road to the market. This fabulous B-rated family home is ideally located on the highly popular \"Deerpark\" development with a backdrop of The Dublin Mountains. All local amenities are close by (local shops, schools, parks etc) The Square Shopping Centre and Tallaght LUAS are both within walking distance and the N81, N7 and M50 are all just minutes away by car. This beautifully presented home offers bright and very spacious living accommodation of approx 1,100 sq ft that briefly comprises of a sitting room, an open-plan kitchen/diner, three great sized bedrooms with en-suite to main bedroom, a family bathroom and a downstairs cloakroom/W.C. To the rear is a lovely garden and and ample visitor parking to the front. To view this exceptional property please call us on 01 912 5500"
      },
